# NeuralOps Academic Thesis & Publication Consistency Standards

## Chapter & Telemetry Alignment

- **All thesis chapters in `thesis_final/` MUST cite results from `results/registry/master_ledger.jsonl`**: Never reference phantom runs or unverified benchmark numbers.
- **All figures MUST be auto-generated by `scripts/benchmarks/plot_publication_figures.py`**: Visualizations must stem directly from empirical data pipelines.
- **All 20 thesis agent files in `docs/thesis_agents/` MUST exist before chapter writing**: Agents and section outlines must be defined in advance.

## LaTeX Hygiene & Compilation

- **FORBIDDEN to write "TODO", "TBD", "???", or placeholder numbers in `.tex` files**: Every manuscript table and value must be complete and factual.
- **FORBIDDEN to compile PDF until `pdflatex` passes twice with no errors**: Two clean passes ensure citation references, labels, and bibliographies resolve without warnings or dangling pointers.
